# {{NAME}}

Run tests with `python3 -m unittest -v`. Start the service with `python3 app.py`
and request `http://localhost:8080/healthz`. Set `PORT` to use a different port.

The container expects a Python base pinned by digest and runs as UID 10001.
It writes one structured status record to stdout per request. Wire platform
metrics, tracing, deployment and secret references to your team's conventions.
